# Received design artifacts are never reformatted — they are a delivery, not source.
handoffs/HO-*

# The token layer is a handoff, extracted VERBATIM from the Claude Design project.
# Prettier had been reformatting it — lowercasing hex, collapsing the column
# alignment, rewriting `.74` as `0.74` — so the file was byte-different from the
# source it claims to copy while still being described as verbatim. The values were
# equivalent, which is exactly what made it easy to miss. Diffing against the design
# source has to be a byte comparison for that claim to mean anything.
src/theme/tokens.css

